                "source": "narrative",
                "kind": "fact",
                "entityId": "r:9b9b0ac92033642c:t1:e:person_2",
                "text": "村民乙附和村民甲的说法，称那里有“不干净的东西”。",
                "runId": "463c5de9-86c4-4358-8d2b-27d7978b32be",
                "turnId": 1
              }
            ],
